#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.Description
msgctxt ",D3DA682949B946E5980215BBE6B17982"
msgid "A quiet Pandora that drifted through ruined cities where even light feared to remain."
msgstr "Тихая Пандора, скитавшаяся по руинам городов, где даже свет боялся задержаться."

#. Key:	D420840241BE9214F851CABA6FF6AEAD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.DisplayName
#: /Game/Pandora/Data/DA_Pandora_Darkness.DA_Pandora_Darkness.DisplayName
